    "created_at": "2026-11-23T19:55:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T19:55:41Z",
    "body": "Known issues: these open `P1` and `P2` issues are not on the cut list. Their fixes ship in the next minor. `RELEASE_NOTES.md` lists them too.\n\n- #3699 (P1): Mill posts fanuc, doosan-dnm, mazak, sinumerik, tormach, linuxcnc: the G84 tap feed is rounded to a whole mm/min\n- #3339 (P2): Start and exit points: move the picks to one operation-level project key\n- #3336 (P2): Performance: the stock simulation is very slow - it runs on the CPU, the GPU shader path is not built\n- #3334 (P2): Start and exit points: Plasma Profile and the future waterjet kinds (pierce point and cancel point)\n- #3333 (P2): Start and exit points: Sinker Burn and Sinker Side Burn (start and end of the orbit and the side move)\n- #3332 (P2): Start and exit points: Wire Contour (threading point into the shared pick, exit on open runs)\n- #3331 (P2): Start and exit points: turning kinds (start in the Z-X plane)\n- #3330 (P2): Start and exit points: multi-axis kinds (5-axis, swarf, rotary, flow, multi-axis rough and contour)\n- #3329 (P2): Start and exit points: 3D kinds (3D Pocket, 3D Finish, Deburr)\n- #3328 (P2): Start and exit points: drilling order (Drill, Bore, Thread mill - first hole and last hole)\n- #3327 (P2): Start and exit points: 2D Adaptive (entry of the first pass, end of the last pass)\n- #3326 (P2): Start and exit points: Face raster (first row corner, last row end)\n- #3325 (P2): Start and exit points: 2D ring and chain kinds (Pocket, Offset, Circular, Slot, Trochoidal slot, Trace, Engrave, Chamfer)\n- #2629 (P2): GPU stock sim S3: viewport playback cuts on the GPU, with CPU fallback\n- #1473 (P2): Start and exit points: exit points, viewport pick, and the cases the first contour slice refuses\n- #1448 (P2): Operations: user-set start and exit points, path regenerated to them\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
