    "body": "Notes from the coordinator. No push follows: the gated head stays `f729592f0`.\n\n- PR count: `git log --first-parent --merges v0.25.0..6167d30af` gives 184 PR merges. This agrees with the release notes. The search by date gives 185, because it also counts the merge at the time of the tag. The earlier counts of 172 and 181 came from a narrower search and a stale fetch.\n- `RECOMMENDED.md`: the decision of #2929 uses an H1 heading. Fix it in the next minor. Do not change it on this branch.\n- The cut gate (run 45253909192) waits for the `camcraft-cut` runner. The maintainer starts that runner.\n",
